<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimate Thursday's hog slaughter from 365,000 to 369,000 head versus 371,000 a week ago and 359,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 124,000 to 132,000 head against 131,000 a week ago and 132,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725</p>
</text>
